```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: dom_labels exposes one label per pushed node")
var s = DevToolsAttachSession.new()
s.attach(1)
s.begin_snapshot()
s.push_element("html", 0)
s.push_element("body", 1)
s.push_text("hi", 2)
